ion in chile  that the uh 60-day constitutionally  mandated waiting period between the  election of a president in this case  salvador allende  and his confirmation inauguration  would be used  for a campaign of murder  and subversion in order that that  transition not occur  and this involved the cold-blooded  planning of of the murder of general  renee schneider  the head of the chilean armed forces  an honorable conservative and  constitutionalist officer in a country  which i repeat was a democracy  that had  opened diplomatic relations and trade  relations with the united states and  posed no threat to it  and that murder is now  what a lawyer i think could decently  call a lay down case  a lay down case from soup to nuts we  know  who commissioned it who paid for it who  organized it who shipped the illegal  money who shipped the dirty weapons  to chile to have this done  and who paid the murderers after the  crime had been committed and the same  name and the same face  recurs throughout we charge henrique  with murder for that and we say that a  society that  tolerates him is tolerating that too and  that's therefore a big reproach  to a society that claims to be bound by  law  responsive to justice  and it's a it's of course an utter  cynical  negation of all the claims that have  been made about  democratic peaceful orderly transition  um as i said of the um of the four  people who  conducted the election subversion in  1968 only one remains unindicted  if you now look at the international  scene and see the people with whom dr  kissinger was in business  during his tenure in office you will  find that almost all of them also are in  jail in their own countries or are going  there  of of mr kessinger's business and  political partners mr suharto  general pinochet uh general papadopoulos  in uh in greece  uh the the uh brigadiers in bangladesh  who um  committed the assassination of sheikh  mujib  and quite a number of others  are in jail i'm glad to say tried in  courts  proper courts in their own countries  and condemned to life imprisonment  once again the grand exception is the  man who made their political careers or  military careers  possible and he dwells as a  an honored citizen among us and we say  too that that is our approach  your approach to any society that  considers itself internationally law  bound  or  responsive to the claims of justice on  the  international scale so  um let that be my  opening  bid and let me accept  counteroffers from or enlargements or um  a very strong bid undercuts from  christopher  uh these distinguished gentlemen thank  you scott  uh christopher i'm not sure this is  directly responsive to your bid but i  think  i share  with you and everyone here a deep  concern about accountability

